# Feature description: Product of COMPACTNESS_CIRCULARITY_RATIO and MAX.LENGTH_RECTANGULARITY (COMPACTNESS_CIRCULARITY_RATIO * MAX.LENGTH_RECTANGULARITY).
# Usefulness: Combining compactness and rectangularity allows the model to better capture differences in overall shape complexity, aiding in differentiating compact circular shapes like SAABs from more rectangular shapes like BUSES and VANS.
df['SHAPE_COMPLEXITY'] = df['COMPACTNESS_CIRCULARITY_RATIO'] * df['MAX.LENGTH_RECTANGULARITY']
